Here's a new version of the "layer 7" patch (matches application layer
data based on regular expressions), which I'm interested in having
included in patch-o-matic.  (Documentation at http://l7-filter.sf.net )

Last time I posted a patch, there was some concern about the locking code.
Since then, I've improved it and I believe it to be correct, but I have
not actually had an opportunity to test it on an SMP box.  However, this
version has been filtering 30 users' traffic on a UP box without any
problem for a week and a half.  Before then, I had been testing the
previous version (identical except for lack of locking) under the same
load without incident for several months.  So I believe the code to be
stable.

Please let me know if this patch is acceptable for inclusion in
patch-o-matic, and, if not, what needs to be fixed.

Thanks,
matthew
